ss=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/17/91006211/d8e889d90ebf4e330617e726d06599d8_1161557355271761855.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>真红骑士 · 月蚀</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">被动提供了初始SP和全伤加成，真红使用时使用一次大招即可叠满两层，此时武器主动两段可以造成共计4900%的恐怖伤害，但需注意二段使用后45S内基本没有战斗力，一般只在收尾时使用</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/17/91006211/dfef0132b3af1dc2f6791065a20e99b8_4331504936848181793.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>血色玫瑰</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">可选的毕业超限武器，和涅炎剑·史尔特尔相比爆发更高，但是持续作战不如涅炎剑·史尔特尔。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/91006211/3465a0c1b6f2b3575ac047bdb972270c_66945531356314592.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">真红骑士·月蚀的专属超限武器，面板较高，被动技能拥有全伤加成和初始能量效果。主动技能可以造成倍率极高的一次火焰伤害并且施加火易伤效果，消耗25及以上能量可以叠加充能；2层充能状态下的主动技能能够造成更高额的伤害，但是主动会有强力的负面效果，所以一般仅在收尾时使用。这把武器弥补了真红骑士·月蚀本身倍率过低的问题，使其在终极区战场的月魂和女王可以打出接近顶分的分数。对于玫瑰而言亦可以替代涅炎剑·史尔特尔在深渊使用。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/91006211/3465a0c1b6f2b3575ac047bdb972270c_66945531356314592.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
